OpenBot Local 0003: Antigravity (Gemini) starts replying sooner on the phone.

- Antigravity sessions and its provider CLI stay open 60 min idle (other providers keep 10 min);
  the pool still closes idle sessions beyond 2 (oldest first) and on low memory.
- A session's own process starts with AGY_ACP_DEFAULT_MODEL=<model>-<effort>, so Antigravity does
  not rebuild the agent (harness + MCP servers) on the first prompt of a cold session.
- Marking an Antigravity chat read (opening it, or returning to the app on it) opens its provider
  session in the background (thread/read), at most every 2 min, only when no turn runs or starts.
- Timings in providers.log: agent-timing "Turn started." / "Antigravity chat prewarmed.",
  acp-client "ACP session process ready." / "ACP session opened." / "ACP turn prompt sent." /
  "ACP turn first update.".

